description.narrative:
Examples of results achieved by AU-PAPS, made possible through Swedens core funding: 
-The Peace and Security Councol achieved a consolidated African position on UN financing of AU-mandated peace operations, leading to a 2023 UN Security Council Resolution and follow-up implementation groups: 
-Continued maintenance of the Continental Early Warning System;
-Facilitation of the Panel of the Wise; 
-The Peace Fund has seen significant progress, it nearly reached the 400 million USD funding goal and has established a robust governance structure;
-Financial reform leading to Member States funding 100 % of the operational budget;
-Development of a new AU Strategic Plan (2024-2033) linking goals, responsible entities, and resources, which improves accountability, coherence and results-based management;
-Improved partnership mechanisms between AU and donors under the Joint Financing Agreement (JFA), making AUs operations more efficient.
